--[[
    UPDATED BHOP API
    Current GameMechanics-based replacement

    Exposes:
        setgains(multiplier)
        setgravity(multiplier)
        setwalkspeed(value)
        setfriction(multiplier)
        settime(offset)            -- currently unsupported
        resetbhopapi()
        rescanbhopapi()
        bhopstatus()

    Notes:
    - setgains uses active StyleInfo.mv
    - setgravity uses GameMechanics:SetGravity when available
    - setwalkspeed patches current GameMechanics constant 18
    - setfriction patches current GameMechanics constant 90
    - settime is intentionally not guessed yet
]]

